{"id":"n62869-1-7","stage":4,"title":"서론 · 绪论","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62869-1-7-1","ko":"아직도 할 얘기가 많이 남아 있어요?","zh":"还有好多话没说吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기가","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기가","audio":"/audio/e08f5bc1f39ccc531481.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"남아","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아","audio":"/audio/6ab4b405a40e3c3ced24.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI